          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="font-label text-primary font-bold text-sm mb-2">PRE-CUT SHEET</p>
            <p class="font-body text-on-surface text-sm">10/25mm | custom dimensions</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <section class="mb-12">
        <h2 class="font-headline text-2xl font-bold text-on-surface mb-6">Anti-Static FAQs</h2>
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <details class="group border border-outline-variant/20 rounded-lg p-4">
            <summary class="font-label font-bold text-on-surface cursor-pointer">What's the difference between pink anti-static and standard bubble wrap?</summary>
            <p class="font-body text-on-surface text-sm mt-3 leading-relaxed">Pink wrap dissipates static charge harmlessly; standard clear wrap builds it up and can zap sensitive ICs.</p>
          </details>
          <details class="group border border-outline-variant/20 rounded-lg p-4">
            <summary class="font-label font-bold text-on-surface cursor-pointer">Is pink the same as ESD-safe shielding?</summary>
            <p class="font-body text-on-surface text-sm mt-3 leading-relaxed">No — pink prevents static generation but doesn't shield from external ESD. For Class 1 components combine with metallised shielding bags.</p>
          </details>
          <details class="group border border-outline-variant/20 rounded-lg p-4">
            <summary class="font-label font-bold text-on-surface cursor-pointer">What components need anti-static wrap?</summary>
            <p class="font-body text-on-surface text-sm mt-3 leading-relaxed">All MOSFET, CMOS, EPROM, high-density memory, and sensitive ICs. Most modern silicon benefits from it.</p>
          </details>
          <details class="group border border-outline-variant/20 rounded-lg p-4">
            <summary class="font-label font-bold text-on-surface cursor-pointer">How long does anti-static treatment last?</summary>
            <p class="font-body text-on-surface text-sm mt-3 leading-relaxed">12-24 months from manufacture date. We ship stock with at least 12 months effective life.</p>
          </details>
          <details class="group border border-outline-variant/20 rounded-lg p-4">
            <summary class="font-label font-bold text-on-surface cursor-pointer">Do you supply machine-compatible rolls?</summary>
            <p class="font-body text-on-surface text-sm mt-3 leading-relaxed">Yes — 500mm and 1000mm wide rolls compatible with most semi-automatic cushioning equipment.</p>
          </details>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="mb-12 bg-primary/5 border border-primary/20 rounded-lg p-8">
